			"notes": "# New features\n* Commands now show modded blocks and items (feature copied from Polymer :heart:)\n* Added license warning\n\n# Fixes\n* Fixed bug with tags that got reintroduced in 1.17 (#103)\n* Fixed bug with dust particles produced by walking on modded blocks not being remapped (#101)\n* A lot of other refactors to do with remapping blocks. PolyMc is now far more specific. This fixes a bug with WorldEdit (#88)\n* Fixed NPE (#99)\n* Newly made resource packs will now use a pack format of 7 instead of 6."
